Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "\[ScriptL]=4 CHECK:",
 StyleBox[" (4,2), (4,4) have p3\[CloseCurlyQuote]s which are OFF by -1 so \
that\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \[PlusMinus]\[Pi] .\n(4,1), (4,3) have p4\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s which are also OFF by -1, BUT the phase of (4,1), (4,3) \
somehow AGREE mod 2\[Pi] \nI think this is due to the \[PlusMinus] ambiguity \
of X12 in the C code as I show below.",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]]
}], "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7349700552461977`*^9, 3.734970118494976*^9}, {
  3.734970607390394*^9, 3.734970665454255*^9}, {3.7349728146933603`*^9, 
